# What graphify must not turn into graph nodes.
#
# Writing this file replaces graphify's implicit gitignore-derived skipping, so
# the previously-implicit entries are repeated here explicitly. Keep it in sync
# with .gitignore when a new local-artifact directory appears.

# Local tool state, not a fact about this project: the impeccable hook cache is
# a per-machine record of which files were edited when, and it still carries
# pre-cutover `ts/src/...` paths that no longer exist.
.impeccable/

# Throwaway smoke/probe scripts and handoff drafts (murmur-smoke) — never committed.
scratch/

# Local dev-session artifacts and the graph's own output.
.dev/
graphify-out/
node_modules/
.github/hooks/
